{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/c294b3c5138aea7ee19886b81ab4678c.poster.avif?t=1774277112\" width=616 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/c294b3c5138aea7ee19886b81ab4678c.webm?t=1774277112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/c294b3c5138aea7ee19886b81ab4678c.mp4?t=1774277112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This demo is a small slice of a bigger project.\u00a0Make sure to <strong>Wishlist</strong>\u00a0<strong>The Game</strong> so you don\u2019t miss the full release!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Play as Heather, a young woman working the late shift at a quiet diner near Coker Creek, Tennessee.</strong></i><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But tonight isn\u2019t just another slow night shift. <strong>A brutal murder</strong> has taken place in the woods nearby, matching the patterns of an <strong>infamous killer</strong> the authorities have been chasing for years. Locals call him the <i><strong>Ghost Ripper</strong></i>. Tonight he is out there hunting for prey...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>People go missing here every year.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The question is\u2026 <strong>can you survive the night?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/d676efa304493408dc5e7efad336a2f2.poster.avif?t=1774277112\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/d676efa304493408dc5e7efad336a2f2.webm?t=1774277112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/7780923dc3cf9061d593ec2930cda241.poster.avif?t=1774277112\" width=640 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/7780923dc3cf9061d593ec2930cda241.webm?t=1774277112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/7780923dc3cf9061d593ec2930cda241.mp4?t=1774277112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Ghost Ripper</strong>, you play as Heather, a diner waitress abducted during her night shift and held captive in an abandoned asylum haunted by a brutal killer known as \u201cThe Ghost Ripper.\u201d Explore the  remnants of the abandoned asylum, uncover the killer\u2019s dark past, and solve environmental puzzles to make it out alive... but beware, he is always watching your move.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Story:</strong> Uncover the <strong>dark backstory of the killer</strong> through <strong>videotapes</strong> and <strong>scattered notes</strong> hidden throughout the asylum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Aesthetic:</strong>\u00a0Immerse yourself in a nostalgic, <strong>PS1/PS2</strong>-inspired visual style, with <strong>low-poly graphics</strong> and an eerie atmosphere that pay homage to classic survival horror games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80s Slasher Horror Style:</strong> Experience the raw, grimy look of classic VHS-era slashers, brought to life with authentic CRT filters and analog-style visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/9b70fc6fafef18d7eb9383b531a28f1b.poster.avif?t=1774277112\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/9b70fc6fafef18d7eb9383b531a28f1b.webm?t=1774277112\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/9b70fc6fafef18d7eb9383b531a28f1b.mp4?t=1774277112\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> A <strong>tense atmosphere</strong>, <strong>intense chases</strong>, and an ever-present sense of danger <strong>will keep you on edge</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth-Oriented Gameplay:</strong> Use <strong>stealth</strong> to avoid the killer, don't make a noise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Puzzles:</strong> Solve environment-based <strong>puzzles</strong> to progress through the asylum.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror:</strong> Manage <strong>limited resources</strong>, avoid the killer, and survive his deadly chase.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Can you survive the night, or will you become the next victim of the Ghost Ripper?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/d207c7e7d5f4a10348774bc5af617439.avif?t=1774277112\" width=750 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be sure to join the Third Eye's Discord server to keep up with the latest updates and have a good time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Feel free to use art\u00a0from our\u00a0PressKit\u00a0for your thumbnails or posts here!\u00a0</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>impress.games/press-kit/third-eye-studios/ghost-ripper</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694230?t=1774277112","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694230?t=1774277112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/7a6cae077cb40f9436298fdcf6358a0bf53e5e1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774277112","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/7a6cae077cb40f9436298fdcf6358a0bf53e5e1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774277112","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains graphic violence, disturbing imagery, and psychological horror. Some scenes may also feature flashing lights or photosensitive content. Viewer discretion is advised."},"demos":[{"appid":3796920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694230/extras/c294b3c5138aea7ee19